till talks about Beasts <i>creating</i> Heroes and whatnot. The chapter is missing post-revision terminology or using pre-revision one because it's the pre-revision version.<br /> <br /> Did the Introduction also get switched around? Because right now it's the same as the shared revisions, but we were told they might redo it to be more indicative of the full book after they were done rewriting the rest. And right now the introduction isnt that indicative of or accurate to some important details of the Begotten.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/188-yeoflittlefaith","name":"YeOfLittleFaith","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar188_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1159"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-10-28T20:26:35-07:00","id":736660,"title":"","content":"<b>p. 9: </b>The lines &quot;<b>Do you want to go back to sleep, baby?</b>&quot; and the two instances of <b>&quot;Do you want to stay up with me?</b>&quot; should probably be in bold-italic, like the Dark Mother's lines on <b>p. 147</b>, or else they get a bit lost in the text.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><hr /><b>Social justice vampire/freelancer | He/Him</b><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#A52A2A\"><b>Actual Play:</b></span> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-requiem/852858-vampire-the-requiem-%E2%80%93-bloodlines-ap\" target=\"_blank\">Vampire: The Requiem \u2013 Bloodlines</a><br /> <span style=\"color:#A52A2A\"><b>Masquiem:</b></span> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-requiem/5268-13-licks-the-curses-of-caine-in-blood-smoke\" target=\"_blank\">Curses of Caine in Requiem 2nd</a><br /> <span style=\"color