":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/192-yossarian","name":"Yossarian","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar192_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2297"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-10-28T21:39:31-07:00","id":736868,"title":"","content":"<b>p. 3, Left column under Chapter One: </b>The subsection is listed as &quot;The Nemeses&quot;, but none of the other Hungers have a &quot;The&quot;. This is also in the relevant PDF Bookmark.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><hr /><b>Social justice vampire/freelancer | He/Him</b><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#A52A2A\"><b>Actual Play:</b></span> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-requiem/852858-vampire-the-requiem-%E2%80%93-bloodlines-ap\" target=\"_blank\">Vampire: The Requiem \u2013 Bloodlines</a><br /> <span style=\"color:#A52A2A\"><b>Masquiem:</b></span> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-requiem/5268-13-licks-the-curses-of-caine-in-blood-smoke\" target=\"_blank\">Curses of Caine in Requiem 2nd</a><br /> <span style=\"color:#A52A2A\"><b>Storytellers Vault: </b></span><a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/browse.php?author=None%20More%20Dark%20Publishing#affiliate_id=321925\" target=\"_blank\">Author Page</a>","edited":{"userid":192,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/192-yossarian","user":"Yossarian","date":". 10-29-2015, 01:23 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/192-yossarian","name":"Yossarian","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar192_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2297"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-10-28T22:20:39-07:00","id":736983,"title":"","content":"Minor typo, I think. Page 235 in the &quot;THE UNFETTERED AND OTHER REALMS&quot; sidebar: &quot;Rumors about in regards to the results of these explorations.&quot; I'm fairly certain that should start with &quot;Rumors abound&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5267-bitera","name":"Bitera","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5267_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-10-28T22:31:28-07:00","id":737011,"title":"","content":"p.54<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> THE VIEW FROM WITHOUT:<br /> JULIA PHOENIX, GALATEID<br /> . . .The woman turned and exhaled fire. And I saw \u2014 I promise, I saw \u2014 the dragon, superimposed on her, mighty and terrible . . . </div> </div> </div>This may be nitpicky, but isn't the expression usually &quot;I swear&quot;, not &quot;I promise&quot;?<br /> <br /> P.59<br /> <br /> In the Micah, Ogre Earthbones sidebar:<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> But you know what? I asked her, &quot;you never take them? Never take them away.&quot; </div> </div> </div>The punctuation doesn\u2019t make sense in this line. Either you have a stray question mark after &quot;what&quot;, or you're missing quote marks around &quot;But you know what?&quot;<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> They too are dream-walkers steeped in legend, and Seemings and Families share some similarities. </div> </div> </div>You might need commas around &quot;too&quot;. You can argue the point, but generally that's how that phrase is set up.<br /> <br /> p.60<br /> <br /> Possible typo in the legend of Tiamat. Shouldn't it read, &quot;Marduk, jealous <i>son</i>&quot;? And not &quot;Marduk, jealous <i>sun</i>)?<br /> <br /> P.61<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> That whisper is the reason a Beast gets up in the morning, or carries on when her brood is slain and an ax-happy Hero prepares his coup de gr<span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman\">\u00e2</span>ce. </div> </div> </div>Got a typo here - &quot;Axe&quot; has an &quot;e&quot; in it<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> A sated Beast takes the pain that threw her victim\u2019s life into a spiral of self-hatred and sorrow and says <i>I can do better</i>. She tortures the world until it feeds her again. </div> </div> </div>Another judgment call. Should there be a comma before &quot;I can do better&quot; (and maybe quote marks around it, too)?<br /> <br /> P. 63<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> Gossamer\u2019s Hunger is a brilliant spectrum. . . .<br /> <br /> The people love him. For decades, Vikram\u2019s fellow citizens . . .<br /> <br /> Luka\u2019s a Predator. . .<br /> <br /> They say that internal affairs is for slimeballs. . .<br /> <br /> He has always needed to burn. As a kid, Levin . . </div> </div> </div>Up until this point, all the other character blurbs are italicized. I can understand a hesitancy to do so here, since there are so many . . . but doing so really sets them off from the general text (in a good way). Maybe use the alternating spot color blocks (like the other lists) along with italics?<br /> <br /> Also - this is the second place where non-standard pronouns are used for an ambiguously gendered character. &quot;Zie&quot; and &quot;hir&quot;, and so on. And, frankly, I had to check multiple sources to verify that you weren't just making them up, because the first dictionaries I pulled didn't have them. Are you sure its a good idea to use such niche terms?<br /> <br /> p.64<br /> <br /> Should the lesson of &quot;Attention&quot; actually be &quot;Pay attention&quot;?<br /> <br /> P.65-66<br /> <br /> As with the &quot;Starving&quot; list, both &quot;Home&quot; and &quot;Family Secrets&quot; have lengthy lists of character blurbs, with no italics or spot color blocks to distinguish them<br /> <br /> p. 66<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> Changelings live and breathe fate, just as the Norn does. </div> </div> </div>&quot;The Norn&quot; (three Norse goddesses who govern fate) are plural, so it should be &quot;do&quot; not &quot;does&quot;<br /> <br /> p.67<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> She is born in blood again and again. </div> </div> </div>Another judgment call, but normally you'd find a comma after &quot;blood&quot;<br /> <br /> p. 68<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> They Hero longs to enter a Beast\u2019s Lair </div> </div> </div>Think you've got another typo - shouldn't it be &quot;The Hero&quot;, not &quot;They Hero&quot;?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":4624,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4624-one-vorlon","user":"One Vorlon","date":".  Missed the Hero typo 10-29-2015, 01:34 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4624-one-vorlon","name":"One Vorlon","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4624_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"537"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-10-28T22:55:02-07:00","id":737027,"title":"","content":"Pretty sure this is supposed to be in past tense.<br /> <br /> Page 12: you were <b>welcome</b> into a brood. ---&gt; you were <b>welcomed</b> into a brood.<br /> <br /> <br /> <br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5284-sanaelar","name":"Sanaelar","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5284_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"16"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-10-29T05:19:31-07:00","id":737755,"title":"","content":"Page 15, 3rd paragraph from the bottom (last under the heading &quot;The Lair&quot;)<br /> <br /> 3rd sentence:<br /> &quot;A Hero who manages to breach the Lair of one Beast in the brood can use it access any others connected to it...&quot;<br /> <br /> Suggestions:<br /> &quot;A Hero who manages to breach the Lair of one Beast in the brood can use it <span style=\"color:#FF0000\"><b>to </b></span>access any others connected to it...&quot;<br /> <br /> &quot;A Hero who manages to breach the Lair of one Beast in the brood can<span style=\"color:#FF0000\"><b>, using it, </b></span>access any others connected to it...&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[